#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:3
#: 5bd9facb1df946969a51476d9306175a
msgid "Antenna Tracker"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:9
#: 918de8bf4abd4f11abbd0c35cc0e6da9
msgid "This is an improved antenna tracker, where the APM is mounted on an antenna tracker (with a GPS module) which in turn is connected to the ground station. Using the positions of the APM on the UAV and the APM on the antenna, this module will send commands to the antenna APM to alter its azimuth/elevation (via servos on the APM) to maintain tracking with the UAV."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:16
#: 4a38df70e6ef46349a3c23a9ae5e11c7
msgid "Use ``tracker set port <portname.``` and ``tracker set baudrate <n>``` to set the serial port and baudrate of the tracker."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:19
#: 3a84be26586e449f99f322f30302ae36
msgid "Use ``tracker arm`` and ``tracker disarm`` to arm and disarm the servos on the tracker respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:22
#: f8990639e6b64ba88fb79193bb650ce8
msgid "``tracker level`` will perform the level calibration routine and ``tracker calpress`` will calibrate the barometer, so that air pressure corrections can be sent back to the UAV (for a more accurate altitude estimation)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:27
#: 88e43aa567134082a0cd7bbf4bf05072
msgid "``tracker start`` will start the tracking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:29
#: d43f7d5c9e074fc3944f53148b4d3f99
msgid "There are several parameters for the tracker, to specify the serial port that the antenna tracker APM is on. Use ``tracker param [set|show|fetch|help]`` to manage the parameters. There are three parameters - port, baud and debug."
msgstr ""
